{"slug": "cdns", "voice": "af_heart", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 295.775, "contentHash": "efdfcafbdabbeb8f308e849cbaa1d4678414490b50ba5b9234f93ef4317d00ba", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "Content Delivery Networks", "start": 0.0, "end": 2.075, "words": [{"text": "Content", "start": 0.275, "end": 0.725}, {"text": "Delivery", "start": 0.725, "end": 1.125}, {"text": "Networks", "start": 1.125, "end": 1.85}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "How CDNs put your content on every continent: edge PoPs, cache hierarchies, TTLs and purging, origin shields, and accelerating dynamic content.", "start": 2.075, "end": 13.3, "words": [{"text": "How", "start": 2.35, "end": 2.538}, {"text": "CDNs", "start": 2.538, "end": 3.25}, {"text": "put", "start": 3.25, "end": 3.388}, {"text": "your", "start": 3.388, "end": 3.5}, {"text": "content", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.963}, {"text": "on", "start": 3.963, "end": 4.125}, {"text": "every", "start": 4.125, "end": 4.45}, {"text": "continent", "start": 4.45, "end": 5.325}, {"text": "edge", "start": 5.325, "end": 5.763}, {"text": "PoPs", "start": 5.763, "end": 6.775}, {"text": "cache", "start": 6.775, "end": 7.25}, {"text": "hierarchies", "start": 7.25, "end": 8.1}, {"text": "TTLs", "start": 8.1, "end": 8.9}, {"text": "and", "start": 8.9, "end": 9.038}, {"text": "purging", "start": 9.038, "end": 9.625}, {"text": "origin", "start": 9.625, "end": 10.163}, {"text": "shields", "start": 10.163, "end": 10.775}, {"text": "and", "start": 10.775, "end": 10.962}, {"text": "accelerating", "start": 10.962, "end": 11.675}, {"text": "dynamic", "start": 11.675, "end": 12.2}, {"text": "content", "start": 12.2, "end": 13.05}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 13.3, "end": 15.0, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 13.65, "end": 13.812}, {"text": "this", "start": 13.812, "end": 14.0}, {"text": "matters", "start": 14.0, "end": 14.725}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "The speed of light is not a suggestion — it's a hard limit. A user in Sydney requesting a file from a server in Virginia waits roughly 200 milliseconds just for the round trip, before your server does a single useful thing. No amount of code optimization fixes physics. A CDN (Content Delivery Network) fixes it the only way physics allows: by moving the content closer to the user. Netflix, YouTube, and every fast website you've ever used lean on this trick.", "start": 15.0, "end": 42.775, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 15.275, "end": 15.35}, {"text": "speed", "start": 15.35, "end": 15.613}, {"text": "of", "start": 15.613, "end": 15.7}, {"text": "light", "start": 15.7, "end": 15.975}, {"text": "is", "start": 15.975, "end": 16.125}, {"text": "not", "start": 16.125, "end": 16.312}, {"text": "a", "start": 16.312, "end": 16.375}, {"text": "suggestion", "start": 16.375, "end": 17.15}, {"text": "it's", "start": 17.15, "end": 17.387}, {"text": "a", "start": 17.387, "end": 17.45}, {"text": "hard", "start": 17.45, "end": 17.725}, {"text": "limit", "start": 17.725, "end": 18.45}, {"text": "A", "start": 18.45, "end": 18.712}, {"text": "user", "start": 18.712, "end": 19.1}, {"text": "in", "start": 19.1, "end": 19.262}, {"text": "Sydney", "start": 19.262, "end": 19.6}, {"text": "requesting", "start": 19.6, "end": 20.087}, {"text": "a", "start": 20.087, "end": 20.188}, {"text": "file", "start": 20.188, "end": 20.525}, {"text": "from", "start": 20.525, "end": 20.663}, {"text": "a", "start": 20.663, "end": 20.762}, {"text": "server", "start": 20.762, "end": 21.113}, {"text": "in", "start": 21.113, "end": 21.2}, {"text": "Virginia", "start": 21.2, "end": 21.725}, {"text": "waits", "start": 21.725, "end": 22.05}, {"text": "roughly", "start": 22.05, "end": 22.363}, {"text": "200", "start": 22.363, "end": 22.875}, {"text": "milliseconds", "start": 22.875, "end": 23.538}, {"text": "just", "start": 23.538, "end": 23.788}, {"text": "for", "start": 23.788, "end": 23.887}, {"text": "the", "start": 23.887, "end": 