": "personalized", "start": 90.875, "end": 91.812}, {"text": "API", "start": 91.812, "end": 92.4}, {"text": "responses", "start": 92.4, "end": 93.225}, {"text": "might", "start": 93.225, "end": 93.438}, {"text": "be", "start": 93.438, "end": 93.575}, {"text": "near", "start": 93.575, "end": 93.837}, {"text": "0", "start": 93.837, "end": 94.15}, {"text": "percent", "start": 94.15, "end": 94.85}]}, {"index": 7, "kind": "prose", "text": "The cache hierarchy", "start": 95.1, "end": 96.925, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 95.4, "end": 95.475}, {"text": "cache", "start": 95.475, "end": 95.775}, {"text": "hierarchy", "start": 95.775, "end": 96.65}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Large CDNs don't have just one layer. A typical setup:", "start": 96.925, "end": 101.35, "words": [{"text": "Large", "start": 97.25, "end": 97.55}, {"text": "CDNs", "start": 97.55, "end": 98.225}, {"text": "don't", "start": 98.225, "end": 98.425}, {"text": "have", "start": 98.425, "end": 98.65}, {"text": "just", "start": 98.65, "end": 98.875}, {"text": "one", "start": 98.875, "end": 99.1}, {"text": "layer", "start": 99.1, "end": 99.725}, {"text": "A", "start": 99.725, "end": 99.975}, {"text": "typical", "start": 99.975, "end": 100.412}, {"text": "setup", "start": 100.412, "end": 101.075}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "Each layer shields the one below it. The origin shield is the unsung hero: a single caching layer that collapses duplicate misses from many edges into one request to your origin. Without it, a cache flush across 300 edges means 300 simultaneous requests to your origin — the thundering herd's globe-trotting cousin (see Caching Strategies).", "start": 101.35, "end": 124.1, "words": [{"text": "Each", "start": 101.65, "end": 101.9}, {"text": "layer", "start": 101.9, "end": 102.312}, {"text": "shields", "start": 102.312, "end": 102.675}, {"text": "the", "start": 102.675, "end": 102.775}, {"text": "one", "start": 102.775, "end": 103.0}, {"text": "below", "start": 103