 "resolves", "start": 244.6, "end": 245.125}, {"text": "to", "start": 245.125, "end": 245.262}, {"text": "one", "start": 245.262, "end": 245.537}, {"text": "IP", "start": 245.537, "end": 246.075}, {"text": "advertised", "start": 246.075, "end": 246.8}, {"text": "from", "start": 246.8, "end": 247.012}, {"text": "every", "start": 247.012, "end": 247.35}, {"text": "PoP", "start": 247.35, "end": 248.15}, {"text": "BGP", "start": 248.15, "end": 249.025}, {"text": "routing", "start": 249.025, "end": 249.462}, {"text": "sends", "start": 249.462, "end": 249.837}, {"text": "each", "start": 249.837, "end": 250.162}, {"text": "user", "start": 250.162, "end": 250.525}, {"text": "to", "start": 250.525, "end": 250.612}, {"text": "the", "start": 250.612, "end": 250.7}, {"text": "nearest", "start": 250.7, "end": 251.05}, {"text": "one", "start": 251.05, "end": 251.75}, {"text": "This", "start": 251.75, "end": 252.262}, {"text": "is", "start": 252.262, "end": 252.45}, {"text": "why", "start": 252.45, "end": 252.7}, {"text": "one", "start": 252.7, "end": 253.037}, {"text": "DNS", "start": 253.037, "end": 253.55}, {"text": "answer", "start": 253.55, "end": 254.05}, {"text": "serves", "start": 254.05, "end": 254.412}, {"text": "the", "start": 254.412, "end": 254.5}, {"text": "planet", "start": 254.5, "end": 255.225}]}, {"index": 23, "kind": "prose", "text": "Cost model: you pay mostly for egress bandwidth and requests. A misconfigured cache (low hit ratio) doesn't just hurt latency — it shows up on the invoice, twice.", "start": 255.475, "end": 266.75, "words": [{"text": "Cost", "start": 255.75, "end": 256.1}, {"text": "model", "start": 256.1, "end": 256.6}, {"text": "you", "start": 256.6, "end": 256.8}, {"text": "pay", "start": 256.8, "end": 257.05}, {"text": "mostly", "start": 257.05, "end": 257.475}, {"text": "for", "start": 257.475, "end": 257.637}, {"text": "egress", "start": 257.637, "end": 258.113}, {"text": "bandwidth", "start": 258.113, "end": 258.725}, {"text": "and", "start": 258.725, "end": 258.85}, {"text": "requests", "start": 258.85, "end": 259.9}, {"text": "A", "start": 259.9, "end": 260.163}, {"text": "misconfigured", "start": 260.163, "end": 260.938}, {"text": "cache", "start": 260.938, "end": 261.5}, {"text": "low", "start": 261.5, "end": 261.875}, {"text": "hit", "start": 261.875, "end": 262.075}, {"text": "ratio", "start": 262.075, "end": 262.825}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 262.825, "end": 263.175}, {"text": "just", "start": 263.175, "end": 263.375}, {"text": "hurt", "start": 263.375, "end": 263.6}, {"text": "latency", "start": 263.6, "end": 264.387}, {"text": "it", "start": 264.387, "end": 264.637}, {"text": "shows", "start": 264.637, "end": 264.938}, {"text": "up", "start": 264.938, "end": 265.087}, {"text": "on", "start": 265.087, "end": 265.188}, {"text": "the", "start": 265.188, "end": 265.3}, {"text": "invoice", "start": 265.3, "end": 265.75}, {"text": "twice", "start": 265.75, "end": 266.5}]}, {"index": 24, "kind": "prose", "text": "Takeaways", "start": 266.75, "end": 268.275, "words": [{"text": "Takeaways", "start": 267.1, "end": 267.975}]}, {"index": 25, "kind": "prose", "text": "CDNs beat the speed of light by moving content to edge PoPs near users; the cache hit ratio is the metric that matters.", "start": 268.275, "end": 277.275, "words": [{"text": "CDNs", "start": 268.575, "end": 269.35}, {"text": "beat", "start": 269.35, "end": 269.6}, {"text": "the", "start": 269.6, "end": 269.712}, {"text": "speed", "start": 269.712, "end": 270.037}, {"text": "of", "start": 270.037, "end": 270.15}, {"text": "light", "start": 270.15, "end": 270.662}, {"text": "by", "start": 270.662, "end": 270.85}, {"text": "moving", "start": 270.85, "end": 271.175}, {"text": "content", "start": 271.175, "end": 271.675}, {"text": "to", "start": 271.675, "end": 271.812}, {"text": "edge", "start": 271.812, "end": 272.087}, {"text": "PoPs", "start": 272.087, "end": 272.825}, {"text": "near", "start": 272.825, "end": 273.05}, {"text": "users", "